{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_09_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_09","title":"得果","storyCode":"HS-9","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c8bf3b2ae5d0b61fb8564e0feede10c436966713a3ea3ce90af9258e8c71d013","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"绩所做的一切，只为织就一幅“山河百景图”。而这个计划的根由，还要从一千年前算起。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"narration","text":"原来那些渺小生灵眼中的天地，是这副模样。\n从那片混沌蒙昧中脱身走出，初次行走在苍茫大地上。\n我从何而来，往何处去？\n保留着那副庞大身躯的记忆，还有一些神乎其神的能力，以及有别于眼前芸芸众生的寿命。\n但也只得像懵懂孩童，跟着眼前众人，有样学样。\n岁月漫长，我遇到过两位老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在炎国的北边，有一片荒地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和那里的人们正试着开垦农田。看着一棵棵庄稼从地里长出来，也是十分有趣。不知道该去哪，要不要来这里帮我打打下手？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那里是什么样的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......比起这些城镇要荒凉许多，再加上还有些许从那扇门里跑出来的东西，有点危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你要是想知道，“人”是什么样的，那里说不定是个不错的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间还长，可以慢慢找答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"我第一次知道，原来生命间还有“同胞”这样的概念。\n或许这就是他们能战胜那些庞然大物的原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛劳的农民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是稀奇，昨晚冰雹下那么大，这些庄稼看上去竟然一点事都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是运气好呢？老天看大家种地辛苦，发了点善心呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛劳的农民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绩，是你做的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是觉得，大家辛辛苦苦劳作半年，就因为这一场冰雹毁于一旦，实在是可惜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛劳的农民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"世间万物都有自己的运行规律，一季庄稼毁了，埋在地里，还能化作土地的肥料，来年的庄稼可以长得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛劳的农民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救得了这片地的这一季庄稼，可炎国有多少片这样的农田，有多少靠天吃饭的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛劳的农民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是好心，但人们总要靠自己研究出在这片土地上找活路的办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一天，您也会离去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛劳的农民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛劳的农民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这片土地会永远存在，生命会永远存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"narration","text":"天地万物，都有各自的位置。\n可是我们生于天地间，如无根之木，无水之萍。\n无因无果，无始无终。\n我们又该归于何处？\n时过境迁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是来收粮食的商人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今年各地大旱，听说北边这里的粮仓还有余裕。我来进点粮食，卖到粮食更紧张的地方去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天地不仁风雨不调，实在是苦了这些农民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是荒年，对农民来说未必不是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生莫不是在说梦话，荒年对农民来说怎么能是好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多简单的道理，越是荒年，粮食越贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每斤粮食赚一文，卖五百斤，和每斤粮食赚十文，卖一百斤。这笔账三岁小孩都算得清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从小就生活在这，只知道粮食是用来喂饱百姓，救人性命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的天地，竟还有这样的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又没见过大荒城外的世面，并非人人都是临渊忘水的神人，只是守着这几亩田地，哪能悟出天下那么多道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，我的商队正好缺一个管事，你有没有兴趣，跟我一块去走走？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶叶商贩","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老规矩，货存仓库，先结账，再住店。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两年尚蜀开出来不少茶田，您说要来做茶叶生意。怎么只是在这包下了这一片客栈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一车最上品的“蜀山青”，从这里运到百灶，能赚多少钱，朝廷抽几成税？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上要是平安顺利，能有两成毛利——已经是相当好做的买卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是这来来往往，不愿意老实纳税的茶商都要从这条小路上走，我又能抽多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样看来，还是您做的这笔买卖划算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我分明看到，您扣过一些货物交给了官府？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就是另一笔生意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在官府干活的人，也是要交差的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您做这个生意，既不怕官府找麻烦，也不怕这些茶商捅刀子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那样对他们来说都不是划算买卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是没了我，茶商要么老老实实缴纳税款，要么冒着风险再找运货的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是没了我，官府重新网罗这些走私贩的消息得花多少钱；再或者，官逼商反，平叛又要花多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三赢的买卖，的确是难得的划算生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在尚蜀待了有段时间了，这里的菜式差不多吃腻了。把这边的生意交给别人打理，我们再往东边走走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去东边，做什么生意？矿产，漕运？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么生意赚钱，就做什么生意......这一次，主要还是想回家看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你之前不是问我，有没有一句放之四海而皆准的道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天下熙熙，皆为利来；天下攘攘，皆为利往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法理道德，信仰名誉，世上没有不能写在账本上的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......受教了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所见皆如此。\n我好像，有点明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我算了一笔账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年来，我们兄弟姐妹活在这炎国，各自的账本上，盈亏如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大哥找到了自己的道，但始终不容于世，于人间爱不得、恨不得、纠缠不得，是亏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"令姐逍遥自在，这片天地困不住她，自得其乐，是盈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有几个妹妹，不见得通透，倒也没什么烦恼，不盈不亏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至于二哥......总之，颉死了，无论如何，都是大亏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们一家和炎国人打了一千年的交道，任由他们差遣，这笔账，我实在算不出我们有半点好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......最重要的，是你，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你当真是半点都不曾把利益得失放在心上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取而代之？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了复仇，也为我们，赌一个结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......怎么能做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二分之一，怎么能赢过整体？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事成败几何......你又有多少把握？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我算过很久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"棋盘纵横十九道，棋路算尽......执黑先行者贴七目半，无半分可胜之机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只靠我一人，确实很难做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以需要一些你的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若是我告诉你，如果还有那唯一一点可能，唯有此路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你愿不愿意，赌上全部身家性命？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g16_beautifulland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你追得很紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生对自己当下所作所为或许得有个解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子想要怎样的解释？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挑动邪魔危害百姓，篡夺国家工事，还有，谋害其他代理人生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的所作所为，罪责比起望犹有过之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然对这些罪状我还有些异议，不过，左公子现在想要怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出那匹布，在司岁台的监视下回到京城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按你说的做，我会得到什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个听候判决的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，这个价格我不太想接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是要与炎国为敌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算如此，左公子又能做到什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐上前一步，拔出了刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欺负普通人，有意思吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好小子，居然跟到了这里来，不得不说，要对你刮目相看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来是家务事，麻烦司岁台给我们一点私人空间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们从那颗“心脏”里逃出来，动作比我预想的要快一点。我的妹妹们心态也成熟了不少啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说得好像大家关系很好一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当这是考验？我还以为你是存心想干掉我们来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你销声匿迹这么多年，就是为了织这匹布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿大炎“国祚”织衣服，真有你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去见祂之前，需要这个东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走遍了炎国各地，最终决定要把大荒城织进去的时候，还是有些舍不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们果然是串通好的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他难道都已经准备好了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早该想到，你才是最容易和那个臭棋篓子聊得来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说你不知道，你把这匹布从这里带出去，意味着什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是对炎国明晃晃的宣战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三哥，说实话，在几个哥哥姐姐里我还挺喜欢你的。总觉得很多时候我俩能碰撞出挺不错的主意来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早些时候，你拉着我到处卖夕的赝品画，我也帮了你不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这种事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但抱歉啦，这一次，连我都觉得你还是太激进了点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来，夕妹也不愿意站在我这边了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几百年没有搞过三人以上的家庭派对了，要做的第一件事居然是回到打打杀杀的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这算什么，忆苦饭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能和和气气谈判解决的事，我也希望可以不用动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对妹妹，我怎么下得了手呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别说大话，二对一，你赢面没那么大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能试试看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，就算当年大狩猎的那支军队站在这里，也拦不住我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
